The implementation also includes mechanisms to handle potential memory allocation failures, report the current occupancy and remaining capacity of the octree, and ensure thread safety if the octree will be accessed concurrently by multiple threads. The trade-offs between memory consumption and query speed are considered in the design of the octree, with a focus on optimizing for space efficiency while maintaining good query performance.

