The function also includes pause and resume functionality for collecting data from a stream and saving it to an array, similar to the JavaScript implementation. This feature allows the function to temporarily halt data collection and resume from the last saved state, using standard library functions for handling streams. Efficiently manage memory and ensure data integrity during pauses and resumptions.

