The function then filters transactions based on the specified criteria using `filter_transactions`. This involves iterating over each transaction and checking if it meets the minimum age requirement, maximum number of transactions in the past 3 seconds requirement, and minimum weighted sum requirement. If a transaction meets all of these requirements, it is added to the filtered array.

