    const size_t _maxSize;

    // Stale policy interval (in seconds)
    const size_t _stalePolicyInterval;

    // Vector of requests in the cache
    std::vector<ResourceRequest> _requests;

    // Map of request IDs to requests
    std::unordered_map<std::string, ResourceRequest> _requestMap;

    // Mutex for thread safety
    std::mutex _mutex;

    // Condition variable for signaling stale request purging
    std::condition_variable _cv;

    // Thread for periodically purging stale requests
    std::thread _thread;
};
```
This class provides a cache for `ResourceRequest` objects, with the ability to add new requests, retrieve requests by ID, and evict stale requests automatically. It also supports filtering requests based on metadata and serializing/deserializing the cache state to/from disk. The class is designed to be thread-safe and can handle high-throughput scenarios.

