* Event filtering based on event type, allowing users to retrieve only critical events or all informational events.
* Automatic purging of old events to free up resources and ensure efficient memory usage and performance.
* Compaction of the event log to reduce memory fragmentation.
* Export of the event entries to a file in a standardized format for external analysis tools.
* Graceful handling of scenarios where external monitoring services or databases are unavailable, minimizing the impact on core event processing operations.
